// IntroString :
"P3274201793" "There have been some disturbing disappearances of late. Citizens with some minor mystical connections have been disappearing from their homes, sometimes even from locked rooms with no sign of forced entry. My investigations found some spectral residue, leading me to suspect that the Circle of Thorns is behind these abductions. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to rescue those abductees from the Circle.</A> You only have 90 minutes to rescue the victims."
// AcceptString :
"P3651880400" "Rescue kidnapping victims from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P3435022737" "If my suspicions are correct, the rumors of a Circle ritual to be carried out in the depths of Dark Astoria may coincide with these abductions. The Circle of Thorns will try to stop you, but they are not your priority. You must rescue those people before they come to harm and the Circle's plot comes to fruition."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2502879206" "Stop lead mystic, his coven"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1980615278" "The Circle's plans grow closer to completion, and with it the danger to the abducted grows ever greater. Hurry, {HeroName}, there isn't much time!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3324841494" "The terrified cries of kidnapped victims underscore a low reverberating chanting that fills the air. The air here is strangely warm, and the air tastes of sulfurous flame."

