// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1868717234" "You have disrupted the portal and saved all the potential sacrifices."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1511790099" "Not all of the sacrifices were saved in time. The Circle of Thorns grows in strength."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P852799943" "You've foiled the plans of the Circle of Thorns yet again, {HeroName}. You saved a lot of innocents today, and kept the circle from completing whatever strange pact they were trying to make. I am still puzzled why they chose their targets for the sacrifice, but the important thing now is that all are safe thanks to your valiant efforts."
// RandomFameString :
"P2231279985" "My sister actually was saved by her idol, {HeroName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3923120396" "Sometimes there are no second chances, {HeroName}. I shudder to think of the final fate of those you were unable to rescue. You must remember the stakes that are being fought for, the Circle of Thorns are without pity or remorse in their quest for power and if the city's heroes can't stop them, they shall achieve their ends."

