// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KidnappedArcheologistLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1842531693" "Captured Warrior's Story"
// DetailString :
"P2896588803" "A captured Warrior told you:<br><br>'We heard about that Archos guy. Hey, if he knows how to get the layout on this Oranburger place, fine! Them Circle a' Thorns jerks have been messing with us too long. We figure we can pay 'em back in person and get some stuff to sell while we're at it, all the better. I'll tell you where Archos is. You don't have to get rough.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MapRoomLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1116631868" "Location of Oranbega Map Room"
// DetailString :
"P3150138584" "After you freed him from the Warriors, Dr. Archos told you: <br><br>Yes, I know a great deal of Oranbega. I'm grateful that you could protect me, those Warrior fools were trying to pry out what I've learned. I have discovered not just an entrance to Oranbega that the Circle knows nothing about, but down on those lost streets I've discovered something else. A map room that details the layout of the entire city! I can tell you how to get there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheFalseMap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P13168848" "False Map of Oranbega"
// DetailString :
"P1636800970" "This map of the Lost city of Oranbega seems quite accurate at first, but as you look at it the map begins to fade away. It's some sort of fake!."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheTruthOfTheTrap 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2044203908" "Betrayal"
// DetailString :
"P3444361439" "You realize now that Dr. Archos had set a trap for you. A member of the Circle of Thorns, he had allowed himself to be kidnapped so that he could give false information about a map room of Oranbega to you upon his rescue. He obviously planned to defeat and capture you once they had you deep within Oranbega."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1154039294" "A prominent archeologist, Dr. Maximillian Archos has been kidnapped by the Warriors. He seemed to be onto something involving Oranbega, the lost city of the Circle of Thorns that's buried underneath Paragon City. I don't have a lead on where Archos is being held, but <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You should 'interview' some Warriors and see if any of them know where he is being held</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P1008789584" "Defeat Warriors to find location of Dr. Archos"
// SendOffString :
"P3167898643" "When I say 'interview', I mean engage in combat and defeat, in case you didn't catch my meaning."

