// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Obelisk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4163788873" "Map Of Oranbega"
// Description :
"P2126568468" "Find the map"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3261673306" "You search the Obelisk"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2254148168" "You finish searching the Obelisk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1152238087" "You realize the map you found is a fake. Dr. Archos had lead you into a trap."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1598594460" "I can't believe it. Dr. Archos was a Circle agent all along. The entire thing was a set up to catch you in Oranbega on the promise of a map that probably never existed. The Circle has played us all for fools, but I'm just glad you were able to win through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_CoT_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2635515374" "The Circle of Thorns have been very active lately, they seem to think that recent activity from other groups has distracted the city's heroes, allowing them to work undisturbed. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would like to see a hero demonstrate to the Circle of Thorns that they have not been forgotten</A> by confronting their mystics anywhere they appear."
// AcceptString :
"P4150709544" "Show the Circle of Thorns that the City's heroes are still watching them."
// SendOffString :
"P2258998613" "Hit them anywhere and anytime you can manage to strike them, {HeroName}. They need to know that their actions won't be ignored."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2132417412" "Combat Circle of Thorns menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2653869045" "You must defeat more Circle of Thorns mystics to show them they can't get away with their plans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2262184874" "You have defeated out enough Circle of Thorns mystics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P868153383" "You really showed the Circle of Thorns that we're paying attention to their actions, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_CoT_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P163078974" "There have been reports of Circle of Thorns activity all over Talos Island. The presence of those mad mystics and their summoned creatures is striking fear into the hearts of all of the people of the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who is willing to help curtail the Circle's presence in the zone.</a> "
// AcceptString :
"P1831372616" "Defeat Circle in Talos Island"
// SendOffString :
"P2175206170" "I've heard several reports of Circle activity around New Troy and Cyclops Island, though I'm sure any neighborhood in the zone would welcome your assistance."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2813141338" "Go to Talos Island and defeat Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3891653508" "You have defeated enough members of the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3836232077" "The Circle are a bold group, who prey on the citizens of Paragon city for numerous dark reasons. The whole city is glad to see heroes fighting their menace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_CoT_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3232160577" "Members of the Circle of Thorns have been spotted with some regularity within Dark Astoria. No one knows what they're up to, but it can't be good. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can fight the Circle's presence in the mists of Dark Astoria.</a> I will warn you that it will likely be a very dangerous battle."
// AcceptString :
"P402135414" "Defeat Circle in Dark Astoria"
// SendOffString :
"P3831867853" "Reports filtering out of Astoria indicate that the Circle, while not common in the zone, are present in some number. Often they've been seen on rooftops performing rituals, or even fighting the Banished Pantheon's creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1801721178" "No one knows what the Circle of Thorns are working towards in Dark Astoria. They seem to be opposed to the Banished Pantheon, but no one knows their true intentions. Their presence cannot help the situation, though."

