// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_CoT_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2553672061" "You may not believe this, {HeroName}, but I'm about to send you to help the Circle of Thorns. You see, the Circle's working a big ceremony to try to bind the soul of a deity. As if that wasn't bad enough, it's one of the deities the Banished Pantheon worships! So the Pantheon is moving on their position, and they plan to destroy the obelisk the Circle is using to focus their spell. Now, here's the scary part. If that obelisk is destroyed, it could take an entire section of the city with it! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop that ceremony and prevent the obelisk's destruction.</A> <br><br>If you can't keep that obelisk intact, I'm afraid this mission will be a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P1152493588" "Stop the ceremony and prevent the obelisk's destruction"
// SendOffString :
"P883433418" "You'll need to defeat everybody at that ceremony, but make sure the obelisk remains intact."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2912318583" "Defeat all villains in area"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2664161159" "That ceremony could go nuclear any minute!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3523099617" "You hear the twisted words of a language long forgotten."

