// Dialog :
"P1955254026" "You stopped the ceremony and prevented the obelisk from being destroyed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P472471640" "The obelisk was destroyed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P225965012" "Good work, {HeroName}. If that obelisk had been destroyed, the energy within could have leveled a good chunk of the city. I'll send some MAGI representatives out to collect the thing now. It really ought to be under lock and key."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4216112508" "The good news is, the damage wasn't as bad as I expected. The bad news is, the energy released from the obelisk did some serious damage to those cave networks. We'll have to get some geologists in to verify whether the area is safe. At least you weren't hurt, though. I'm grateful for that."
